1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:07,020
Winter holidays had begun. Tinku and Pinky were going to Nani's village for the very first time.

2
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:12,885
Green fields everywhere, and far away they could see Nani's little house.

3
00:00:13,285 --> 00:00:17,330
Tinku, look! There's Nani's house! Let's race!

4
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:20,375
Wait, Pinky! My bag is so heavy!

5
00:00:25,775 --> 00:00:33,430
Nani hugged them both tight. Nani's sweet goat, Chameli, was wandering around the courtyard.

6
00:00:33,830 --> 00:00:37,765
My children are here! Pinky, look what I got for you.

7
00:00:38,265 --> 00:00:40,770
New anklets! They're so beautiful, Nani!

8
00:00:41,170 --> 00:00:45,465
Tomorrow there's a fair in the village. You'll wear them and dance on the stage, won't you?

9
00:00:45,865 --> 00:00:49,605
Yes, Nani! Chham-chham-chham! I'll dance the best!

10
00:00:50,105 --> 00:00:51,305
Meh-meh!

11
00:00:51,705 --> 00:00:55,940
Chameli was listening very carefully to the chham-chham of the anklets.

12
00:00:56,340 --> 00:00:59,245
Look, Chameli likes the anklets too!

13
00:00:59,645 --> 00:01:05,195
Her old bell broke, you see. That's why she's been so quiet lately.

14
00:01:07,395 --> 00:01:13,150
Night fell. Pinky put the anklets on the window, and they snuggled under the quilt and fell asleep.

15
00:01:16,150 --> 00:01:19,520
At midnight... suddenly, a sound came from the roof.

16
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:24,795
Tinku... Tinku! Wake up! Listen... chham-chham!

17
00:01:25,295 --> 00:01:27,485
Who'd be on the roof at midnight?

18
00:01:28,185 --> 00:01:30,385
My anklets! They're not on the window!

19
00:01:30,885 --> 00:01:33,650
Come on, let's take the torch and look. Slowly.

20
00:01:38,450 --> 00:01:44,350
They tiptoed up the stairs. With every step, their hearts beat louder.

21
00:01:44,950 --> 00:01:46,660
Shhh! Look at the wall...

22
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:52,775
On the wall was a huge shadow... with two pointy horns on its head!

23
00:01:53,175 --> 00:01:54,405
H-horns! RUN!

24
00:01:55,005 --> 00:01:58,880
They turned and ran... straight back under the quilt!

25
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:08,560
Morning came. The rooster crowed. But Pinky was very sad.

26
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:12,830
My anklets are gone. How will I dance at the fair now?

27
00:02:13,330 --> 00:02:17,205
Don't be sad, Pinky. We'll be detectives and find out!

28
00:02:21,205 --> 00:02:25,175
They went up to the roof. There they found some strange things.

29
00:02:25,675 --> 00:02:28,835
Look, dry hay... and these tiny marks.

30
00:02:29,435 --> 00:02:33,150
These don't look like ghost feet. They look like... hooves!

31
00:02:33,750 --> 00:02:37,280
I have a plan! Tonight we'll catch the ghost!

32
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:47,625
That night they hid in a corner of the roof under a quilt. Tinku tied a string of little bells across the stairs.

33
00:02:48,225 --> 00:02:50,405
Tinku, I'm scared.

34
00:02:50,805 --> 00:02:53,025
I'm right here. Just keep the torch ready.

35
00:02:57,225 --> 00:03:03,005
Right at midnight... chham... chham... chham... and then... ting-ting! The bells on the string rang!

36
00:03:03,405 --> 00:03:04,635
NOW! Torch on!

37
00:03:05,635 --> 00:03:07,345
Hey! It's... Chameli!

38
00:03:07,745 --> 00:03:10,575
And your anklets are on her legs! Ha ha ha!

39
00:03:10,875 --> 00:03:12,075
Meh-meh!

40
00:03:14,875 --> 00:03:20,175
Afraid of being caught, Chameli ran all over the roof. Chham-chham-chham!

41
00:03:23,975 --> 00:03:26,140
Stop, Chameli! My anklets!

42
00:03:28,540 --> 00:03:33,695
Chameli slipped and... thud! Into the hay pile! The anklets flew up into the air...

43
00:03:34,295 --> 00:03:35,200
Got them!

44
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:39,690
Hey, hey! What's going on so late at night?

45
00:03:40,190 --> 00:03:45,865
Nani, the roof ghost was Chameli! Every night she wore my anklets and danced!

46
00:03:46,365 --> 00:03:52,175
Poor thing! She must have missed her jingle after her bell broke.

47
00:03:58,575 --> 00:04:03,455
The next evening, the village fair sparkled with colourful lights.

48
00:04:03,955 --> 00:04:09,540
Pinky wore her anklets and danced the most beautiful dance on stage. Chham-chham-chham!

49
00:04:16,540 --> 00:04:21,705
And Chameli? Nani had tied a shiny new bell around her neck.

50
00:04:22,105 --> 00:04:23,305
Meh-meh!

51
00:04:23,805 --> 00:04:26,950
Look! Chameli is dancing with Pinky too!

52
00:04:27,550 --> 00:04:31,305
Chham-chham and ting-ting! We're a superhit pair!

53
00:04:36,705 --> 00:04:42,850
That night there was no ghost in Nani's village... just lots of laughter, and lots of love.

54
00:04:44,850 --> 00:04:48,610
Next time: Golu's crazy race with the vegetables!

55
00:04:49,110 --> 00:04:50,515
Bye-bye, friends!

56
00:04:50,815 --> 00:04:51,805
Bye-bye!
